      "role": "user",
      "content": "i have no idea why you are talking about goblins and wagons, i'm literally just trying to do my job in logistics. please stop with the weird metaphors and just answer the technical parts. \n\nregarding the insurance—since it's CIF, specifically under the 2020 rules, what is the minimum level of coverage the seller is required to provide for the insurance policy?",
